{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00000","source":"Equipped again!","vi":"Trang bị lại đầy đủ rồi!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00001","source":"I won't be needing the Three Sacred\nTreasures.","vi":"Em sẽ không cần Three Sacred Treasures đâu.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00002","source":"I won't be needing the Three Sacred\nTreasures.","vi":"Em sẽ không cần Three Sacred Treasures đâu.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00003","source":"It's finally time for you to square off\nagainst Hades. Are you ready?","vi":"Cuối cùng cũng đến lúc em đối đầu Hades.\nSẵn sàng chưa, Pit?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00004","source":"I am SO ready! I carbo-loaded\nand everything!","vi":"Em sẵn sàng QUÁ rồi!\nEm còn nạp đầy tinh bột nữa!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00005","source":"Great!","vi":"Tốt lắm!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00006","source":"Hades has overstepped his boundaries\nby exploiting and desecrating souls.","vi":"Hades đã vượt quá giới hạn,\nlợi dụng và báng bổ các linh hồn.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00007","source":"He's disrupted the balance between the\nearth, the heavens, and the Underworld.","vi":"Hắn phá vỡ thế cân bằng giữa\ntrần gian, thiên giới và Underworld.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00008","source":"He must be stopped. YOU must stop him.","vi":"Phải ngăn hắn lại. Chính EM\nphải làm điều đó.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00009","source":"It's a tall order, but if anyone can\ndo it, I have faith that you can!","vi":"Đây là nhiệm vụ cực khó.\nNhưng nếu ai làm được, ta tin đó là em!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00010","source":"Leave it to me!","vi":"Cứ để em!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00011","source":"In the name of the heavens, the earth, the\nhumans, and the souls bound for the afterlife...","vi":"Nhân danh thiên giới, trần gian,\nloài người và những linh hồn về cõi sau...","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00012","source":"I WILL defeat Hades!","vi":"Em NHẤT ĐỊNH sẽ đánh bại Hades!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00013","source":"Go now, Pit!","vi":"Đi đi, Pit!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00014","source":"With pleasure!","vi":"Em rất sẵn lòng!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00015","source":"So where's his castle?","vi":"Thế lâu đài của hắn đâu ạ?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00016","source":"Hades doesn't have one.","vi":"Hades không có lâu đài.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00017","source":"What?! The lord of the Underworld can't\neven afford a roof over his head?","vi":"GÌ CƠ?! Chúa tể Underworld\nmà không đủ tiền mua mái nhà à?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00018","source":"No, no, it's not like that.","vi":"Không, không phải thế.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00019","source":"This is his realm, so he could be\nanywhere in this darkness. Or everywhere.","vi":"Đây là lãnh địa của hắn. Hắn có thể\nở bất cứ đâu trong bóng tối. Hoặc khắp nơi.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00020","source":"Then...what's the plan?","vi":"Vậy... kế hoạch là gì ạ?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00021","source":"Just stay alert, Pit.","vi":"Cứ cảnh giác nhé, Pit.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00022","source":"I can sense Hades's presence\nsurrounding us.","vi":"Ta cảm nhận được sự hiện diện\ncủa Hades đang bao quanh chúng ta.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00023","source":"Uh, that's great intel...","vi":"Ờm, tin tình báo hữu ích ghê...","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00024","source":"But do you think you could be a\nbit more specific?","vi":"Nhưng ngài nói cụ thể hơn\nđược chút nào không?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00025","source":"Just a little bit?","vi":"Một chút xíu thôi cũng được!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00026","source":"Hello there!","vi":"Chào đằng ấy!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00027","source":"Augh!","vi":"Á!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00028","source":"I've been so looking forward to your\narrival, Pitty Pat.","vi":"Ta mong ngóng ngày nhóc đến\nlâu lắm rồi, Pitty Pat.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00029","source":"Hades!","vi":"Hades!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00030","source":"Pit!","vi":"Pit!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00031","source":"Hades!","vi":"Hades!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00032","source":"Pit!","vi":"Pit!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00033","source":"Hadeeees!","vi":"Hadeeees!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00034","source":"Piiiiitttt!","vi":"Piiiiitttt!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00035","source":"It's ON!","vi":"CHIẾN THÔI!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00036","source":"Ooh! Do I spy with my little eye the\nThree Sacred Treasures?","vi":"Ồ! Để mắt ta xem thấy gì nào...\nThree Sacred Treasures phải không?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00037","source":"Even your darkness can't hide from\nthe light!","vi":"Bóng tối của ngươi\ncũng không trốn nổi ánh sáng đâu!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00038","source":"Ooh, not bad, Pitty Pat.","vi":"Ồ, khá lắm, Pitty Pat.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00039","source":"That's right! You'd better watch yourself!","vi":"Đúng thế! Liệu hồn đấy!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00040","source":"Now isn't that just...","vi":"Chà, chẳng phải là...","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00041","source":"PRECIOUS!","vi":"ĐÁNG YÊU QUÁ SAO!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00042","source":"Ah-oooooooooooh! Ungh!","vi":"Á-úúúúú! Hự!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00043","source":"Now that felt good!","vi":"Đã cái nư ghê!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00044","source":"Not the Three Sacred Treasures!","vi":"Không! Three Sacred Treasures!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00045","source":"What?! NO!","vi":"Gì cơ?! KHÔNG!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00046","source":"Not quite so tough now, are ya?","vi":"Giờ hết mạnh miệng rồi nhỉ?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00047","source":"Are you OK there, Pit?!","vi":"Pit! Em có sao không?!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00048","source":"Hades has got some RAUNCHY breath!","vi":"Hades bị HÔI MIỆNG kinh khủng!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00049","source":"That's really the least of your\nconcerns.","vi":"Giờ đó là chuyện\nít đáng lo nhất của em đấy.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00050","source":"Huh?!","vi":"Hả?!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00051","source":"Augh!","vi":"Á!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00052","source":"Having fun, Pitty Pat?!","vi":"Vui không, Pitty Pat?!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00053","source":"Oh, put a lid on it.","vi":"Ông im giùm đi.","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00054","source":"Yeah, shut up!","vi":"Đúng đấy, câm miệng!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00055","source":"Yowwwww!","vi":"Áaaaa!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00056","source":"You know what, Pitty Pat?","vi":"Biết gì không, Pitty Pat?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00057","source":"You're looking mighty tasty!","vi":"Nhóc trông NGON MIỆNG lắm!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00058","source":"Down the haaaaaaatch!","vi":"VÀO BỤNG TA NÀOOOO!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00059","source":"No no no no no no no!","vi":"Không không không không không!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00060","source":"Get out of there, Pit!","vi":"Ra khỏi đó mau, Pit!","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00061","source":"Uh-oh...","vi":"Ôi thôi...","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
{"id":"romfs/us/stage/a2300.zrc::[LZ11]::stage/bin.arc::bin/msg_00.bin#00062","source":"Where am I?","vi":"Mình đang ở đâu vậy?","status":"draft","batch":"038"}
